      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This could just backfire too as people may just get more aggressive when they know they've already been voted on. It's not shared to the person so others can silently remove a player. So things don't get any worse.\nAlts are an issue tho I agree but this would cause more issues than it would be solving. With no real solution that I could think of.\nJust wanted to voice my concerns.",
