  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2018-12-13T05:52:26.821Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "It would be nice to be able to know when you are being vote kicked like maybe a warning message appears. This could make it so the person would know that people don't like what they are doing and they can stop or leave on their own accord. Every time I've seen a vote kick appear I have NEVER seen anyone actually walk up to them and tell them to stop first and getting kicked is extremely frustrating as it can interrupt a conversation that a person may be having with their friends. For example, I got maliciously vote kicked while sitting in one spot scrolling thru my avatar list and would have rather been able to leave of my own accord as I wanted to continue exploring the world.\n\nEven worse is the times I have been in the lag free box and somebody gets vote kicked and then comes back on an alt and revenge crashes the whole lobby which sucks for everyone who didn't accept the kick too.",
